        <h2 id="architecture-title">Create a session and observe its first turn</h2>
        <p>Each column is a participant. Read the numbered arrows from top to bottom. Home.razor, SessionHub, and the Anthropic SDK all run inside the ASP.NET Core host; the browser only displays what the Blazor circuit renders, and Managed Agents is the remote service.</p>
